WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
Can I take a look? Here it is for you

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:17,020
It just saves me from finding a trash can and throwing it away. Let’s meet and chat later.

3
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:18,900
Are you the new secretary assistant?

4
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:20,910
hello

5
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:22,470
I'm the new secretary assistant

6
00:00:22,670 --> 00:00:26,210
May I ask whose assistant I am coming in?

7
00:00:26,570 --> 00:00:27,530
Your place is here

8
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:32,660
That's the official position of your intern

9
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:34,350
Secretary General Ying Zhe

10
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:36,110
Am I your assistant?

11
00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:37,870
Just call the secretary-general directly

12
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:39,840
I'm BOSS's secretary

13
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:41,400
He is also the Secretary-General of the Secretarial Group

14
00:00:42,150 --> 00:00:43,630
And you are my assistant

15
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:45,150
BOSS secretary's assistant

16
00:00:45,670 --> 00:00:48,750
No matter how simple this position sounds, Secretary General

17
00:00:48,950 --> 00:00:51,750
Do you have our company's work requirement specifications? Give me a copy.

18
00:00:52,070 --> 00:00:53,070
And my position

19
00:00:53,070 --> 00:00:54,630
Please also send me the scope of work and so on.

20
00:00:54,630 --> 00:00:56,470
Then what is my job today?
